invariant: INV-5
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-trust-separation.sh
reason: WEBPKI_SRCS stops listing webpki_sigalg.c, a file git tracks, so
  the TRUST=webpki object leaves out the signature dispatch its chain
  walk calls, and the list no longer names every webpki*.c file the
  tree holds. The lint requires the TRUST=webpki object to package
  every root webpki*.c file git tracks, so it objects.

--- old
WEBPKI_SRCS := webpki_time.c webpki_name.c webpki_spki.c webpki_sigalg.c webpki_ext.c \
                webpki_cert.c webpki.c
--- new
WEBPKI_SRCS := webpki_time.c webpki_name.c webpki_spki.c webpki_sigalg.c webpki_ext.c \
                webpki.c
